<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Admiral issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Admiral issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Admiral Leisure World Ltd said on Friday it was still in talks to buy an international company which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>The company said on February 27 if the acquisition was succesful, it would be funded partly by the issue of new shares and partly out of borrowings.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to continue to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
